    "created_at": "2016-11-14T14:35:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-14T14:35:26Z",
    "body": "Anyway, you're right, and ECMAScript does the same kind of thing describing its types: https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-list-and-record-specification-type.\n\nAlthough ECMAScript does not seem to use a distinct `<dfn>` for the type and instance.\n\nSo do we want a `<dfn>` distinction between type and instances? And if so, should they all be exported?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
